<title>POLAND: KRAKCHEMIA JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 133,100.</title>
<headline>KRAKCHEMIA JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 133,100.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.13 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.26 vs   0.26</p>
